    "title": "Noah Reed wins 8 Miler at Blackacre Barnstormer on Aug. 30, 2026",
    "text": "Noah Reed wins 8 Miler at Blackacre Barnstormer on Aug. 30, 2026\nNoah Reed won the 8 Miler at the Blackacre Barnstormer on Aug. 30, 2026, with a time of 57:21, according to RunSignUp results.\nReed, listed as from Clarksville, Indiana, competed as a male.\nHallie Mills was the fastest female finisher, finishing in 1:14:46.\nToby Bialzik finished second in 59:54, and DRAKE STALEY was third in 1:01:52.",
